{
    "title": "ShopRite: Groceries & Savings",
    "description": "ShopRite, your friendly local grocery store & supermarket! Everything you need for deals, personalized recipes, and coupons for both in-store and online shopping, in one single grocery app. Order pickup or delivery, or plan your next grocery shopping list. Discover savings with our digital coupons, online promotions and the weekly circular.\r\n\r\nOur app makes it easier to plan and shop while saving you time with these benefits:\r\n\r\nWeekly Circular & Promotions:\r\n\r\n \ud83d\udcc6 Browse and shop items on sale directly from the Weekly Ad.\r\n\r\n \ud83d\udcb8 Look out for other deals and promotions. You\u2019ll find incredible discounts on popular items, making your shopping experience even more rewarding.\r\n\r\nDigital Coupons:\r\n\r\n \ud83d\udcb0 Load additional savings directly to your Price Plus Club loyalty card to redeem at checkout.\r\n\r\nConvenient ways to get your items:\r\n\r\n \ud83d\uded2 In-Store: Easily check items off your list while you shop, and sort them by aisle for easy in-store navigation. Quickly find a ShopRite location near you or check store hours with our easy-to-use store locator.\r\n\r\n \ud83d\ude97 Pickup: Save time with contactless, curbside service. Notify us when you\u2019re on your way, so we can have your order ready upon arrival.\r\n\r\n \ud83d\ude9a Delivery: Get groceries delivered to your doorstep hassle-free! Add a tip for your driver when placing your order.\r\n\r\nSaved Lists:\r\n\r\n \u2705 Create and save shopping lists for future use, making your grocery shopping faster and more organized.\r\n\r\n \ud83d\udcdd Add personalized notes to items, ensuring your preferences and special requests are always remembered.\r\n\r\nScan Product Barcodes:\r\n\r\n \ud83d\udcf7 Scan product barcodes to quickly view an item's product details including packaging, nutritional label or aisle location, and easily add them to your shopping list or cart.\r\n\r\nShoppable Recipes:\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf73 View recipes and add ingredients to your shopping list or cart.\r\n\r\nPersonalized Offers:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd04 Reorder from a curated list of your past purchases and get recommended items on sale each week.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd00 Pre-select your substitution choices at checkout in-case an item you ordered isn\u2019t available.\r\n\r\nProduct Assortment:\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf3d Explore an extensive range of products, from fresh produce to pantry staples, international foods, and specialty items.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Discover our own brands carefully curated for taste, quality, and affordability.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce6 Stock up on essentials with club-sized options. Whether its breakfast and pantry items, or cleaning supplies buying in larger quantities saves you money.\r\n\r\nLoyalty Card Access:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcb3 Save your Price Plus Club card to your Wallet app or directly access it within the ShopRite app.\r\n\r\nSearch Functionality:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Find exactly what you need in seconds with powerful and intuitive search for products, recipes, and coupons.\r\n\r\nDeli and Catering Pre-Orders:\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf70 Order cold cuts, cakes, and catering platters from our Order Express App (where available) for time-saving, customizable options, freshness and hassle-free pickup.\r\n\r\nDownload the ShopRite app and enjoy a seamless shopping experience today! \ud83d\uded2\ud83d\udcf2",
    "descriptionHTML": "ShopRite, your friendly local grocery store &amp; supermarket! Everything you need for deals, personalized recipes, and coupons for both in-store and online shopping, in one single grocery app. Order pickup or delivery, or plan your next grocery shopping list. Discover savings with our digital coupons, online promotions and the weekly circular.<br><br>Our app makes it easier to plan and shop while saving you time with these benefits:<br><br>Weekly Circular &amp; Promotions:<br><br> \ud83d\udcc6 Browse and shop items on sale directly from the Weekly Ad.<br><br> \ud83d\udcb8 Look out for other deals and promotions. You\u2019ll find incredible discounts on popular items, making your shopping experience even more rewarding.<br><br>Digital Coupons:<br><br> \ud83d\udcb0 Load additional savings directly to your Price Plus Club loyalty card to redeem at checkout.<br><br>Convenient ways to get your items:<br><br> \ud83d\uded2 In-Store: Easily check items off your list while you shop, and sort them by aisle for easy in-store navigation. Quickly find a ShopRite location near you or check store hours with our easy-to-use store locator.<br><br> \ud83d\ude97 Pickup: Save time with contactless, curbside service. Notify us when you\u2019re on your way, so we can have your order ready upon arrival.<br><br> \ud83d\ude9a Delivery: Get groceries delivered to your doorstep hassle-free! Add a tip for your driver when placing your order.<br><br>Saved Lists:<br><br> \u2705 Create and save shopping lists for future use, making your grocery shopping faster and more organized.<br><br> \ud83d\udcdd Add personalized notes to items, ensuring your preferences and special requests are always remembered.<br><br>Scan Product Barcodes:<br><br> \ud83d\udcf7 Scan product barcodes to quickly view an item&#39;s product details including packaging, nutritional label or aisle location, and easily add them to your shopping list or cart.<br><br>Shoppable Recipes:<br><br>\ud83c\udf73 View recipes and add ingredients to your shopping list or cart.<br><br>Personalized Offers:<br><br>\ud83d\udd04 Reorder from a curated list of your past purchases and get recommended items on sale each week.<br><br>\ud83d\udd00 Pre-select your substitution choices at checkout in-case an item you ordered isn\u2019t available.<br><br>Product Assortment:<br><br>\ud83c\udf3d Explore an extensive range of products, from fresh produce to pantry staples, international foods, and specialty items.<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Discover our own brands carefully curated for taste, quality, and affordability.<br><br>\ud83d\udce6 Stock up on essentials with club-sized options. Whether its breakfast and pantry items, or cleaning supplies buying in larger quantities saves you money.<br><br>Loyalty Card Access:<br><br>\ud83d\udcb3 Save your Price Plus Club card to your Wallet app or directly access it within the ShopRite app.<br><br>Search Functionality:<br><br>\ud83d\udd0d Find exactly what you need in seconds with powerful and intuitive search for products, recipes, and coupons.<br><br>Deli and Catering Pre-Orders:<br><br>\ud83c\udf70 Order cold cuts, cakes, and catering platters from our Order Express App (where available) for time-saving, customizable options, freshness and hassle-free pickup.<br><br>Download the ShopRite app and enjoy a seamless shopping experience today! \ud83d\uded2\ud83d\udcf2",
